# handle-drag-out (h7-plane): the diamond dragged past the canvas's right
# edge (1423) out to x=1500 and held: the handle keeps following (the
# pan's pointer capture retargets the canvas moves; probed h=11.44), the
# camera unchanged, grab-active with the h,k rulers out. Ends held; the
# release past the edge still ends the drag (probed: modes cleared,
# cursor pan), but its hover state is lag-divergent by construction, so no
# release read belongs to this state.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
query func=x2&a=2&h=1&k=-3
wait 500
move 978 640
wait 200
down
wait 150
move 1500 640 over 160
wait 300
shot handle-drag-out
up
